---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../../components/PageHero.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Browser storage, explained." description="The preview saves preferences and drafts locally; analytics collection is not implemented.">
<PageHero eyebrow="Preview notice \u00b7 15 October 2026" title="Browser storage, explained." lede="The preview saves preferences and drafts locally; analytics collection is not implemented." />
<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-14 prose-kora">
<h2>Preferences</h2>
<p>Local storage remembers your theme and consent choice. The banner records a preference only; accepting it does not currently activate an analytics service.</p>
<h2>Form drafts</h2>
<p>Pilot interest uses session storage for this tab. Contact and demo requests use local storage. Clearing site data removes those local records.</p>
<h2>External services</h2>
<p>Following messaging, email or hosted-site links involves those services and their own storage and privacy behaviour. This notice describes the application source, not every hosting-layer mechanism.</p>
<p><a href="/pilot" class="btn btn-primary">Explore the founding pilot</a></p>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
